  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 9705.01 Application Process",
  "priorExpiration": "2022-07-28",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 9705.01 Application Process.\n\n(a) Applicants shall complete and submit the “2022-23 Body-Worn and Dashboard Camera Fund Grant Application”, version 1.3, for consideration of a grant award.\n\n(b) This application may be downloaded from:\n\nhttp://www.nh.gov/safety/divisions/homeland/index.html.\n\n(c) Applications shall only be submitted online to the email address provided in (d) below. Hard copies or facsimiles shall not be accepted.\n\n(d) Completed applications shall be submitted by emailing Homelandgrants@dos.nh.gov no later than 45 days after the release of the grant application. Applications received after the deadline shall be summarily rejected.\n\n(e) After initial application and award period, if funds still remain, additional grants shall be issued based on availability.\n\nSource. #13338, INTERIM, eff 1-29-22, EXPIRES: 7-28-22; ss by #13365, eff 4-18-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c9700.html"
